pan></a></div></li><li><div><a class="nav-link group" href="/rmp/authors"><span>Authors</span></a></div></li><li><div><a class="nav-link group" href="/rmp/referees"><span>Referees</span></a></div></li><li><div><a class="nav-link group" href="/authors/editorial-policies"><span>Editorial Policies</span></a></div></li><li><div><a class="nav-link group" href="/press"><span>Press</span></a></div></li><li><div><a class="nav-link group" href="/rmp/about"><span>About</span></a></div></li><li><div><a class="nav-link group" href="/rmp/staff"><span>Editorial Team</span></a></div></li><li><div><a class="nav-link group" href="/feeds"><span>RSS</span><div class="IconPlaceholder w-4 h-4 ml-1 5 justify-center items-center relative"><img alt="RSS Feed" class="mr-2 size-[14px] group-hover:text-text-regular-primary" src="/images/tailwind/icons/rss.svg" /></div></a></div></li></ul></div></div></div></header><script>function handleHamburgerButton(obj) {
  if (obj){
    // Toggle the state when clicked on
    const open_state = obj.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === "false";
    obj.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open_state)

    // Display/hide the hamburger menu items
    // Change the hamburger icon
    const menu_items = document.querySelector('#hamburger-menu-contents')
    const open_icon = document.querySelector('#openedHamburgerIcon')
    const closed_icon = document.querySelector('#closedHamburgerIcon')
    if (open_icon && closed_icon){
      if (open_state){
        closed_icon.classList.add('hidden')
        open_icon.classList.remove('hidden')
        menu_items.style='display:grid';
      }
      else {
        closed_icon.classList.remove('hidden')
        open_icon.classList.add('hidden')
        menu_items.style='display:none';
      }
    }
  }
}

// Handle account dropdown clicks for Safari compatibility
// The CSS :focus-within approach doesn't work reliably in Safari
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
  // Ensure parent containers have position relative for absolute positioning
  const dropdownContainers = document.querySelectorAll('.account-info-dropdown');
  dropdownContainers.forEach(function(container) {
    const computedStyle = window.getComputedStyle(container);
    if (computedStyle.position === 'static') {
      container.style.position = 'relative';
    }
  });

  const signedinButtons = document.querySelectorAll('button.signedin');

  signedinButtons.forEach(function(button) {
    button.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      e.stopPropagation();

      // Find the parent dropdown container
      const dropdownContainer = this.closest('.account-info-dropdown');
      if (!dropdownContainer) return;

      // Find the dropdown menu
      const dropdown = dropdownContainer.querySelector('.dropdown');
      if (!dropdown) return;

      // Toggle the dropdown visibility using inline styles to override CSS
      const isCurrentlyVisible = !dropdown.classList.contains('hidden') ;

      if (isCurrentlyVisible) {
        // Hide the dropdown
        dropdown.style.display = 'none';
        dropdown.classList.add('hidden');
        dropdown.classList.remove('grid');
      } else {
        // Show the dropdown
        dropdown.classList.remove('hidden');
        dropdown.classList.add('grid');
        dropdown.style.display = 'grid';
        dropdown.style.visibility = 'visible';
      }
    });
  });

  // Close dropdown when clicking outside
  document.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
    if (!e.target.closest('.account-info-dropdown')) {
      const dropdowns = document.querySelectorAll('.account-info-dropdown .dropdown');
      dropdowns.forEach(function(dropdown) {
        dropdown.style.display = 'none';
        dropdown.classList.add('hidden');
        dropdown.classList.remove('grid');
      });
    }
  });
});</script><main class="w-full" data-testid="main_container" id="main"><div class="generic-main-container"><div data-access-type="closed-access" data-action="mousedown-&gt;article-dialogs#closeOnBackdrop" data-article-type="article" data-controller="article-dialogs" id="article-page-wrapper"><section data-action="mousedown-&gt;article-sections#closeOnBackdrop click-&gt;article-sections#activateTarget" data-controller="article-sections" id="article-body"><dialog class="dialog-contents" data-action="mousedown-&gt;export-citation#closeOnBackdrop" id="export-article-dialog"><div id="export-article-dialog-contents"><div class="p-8 text-text-regular-neutral relative"><div class="dialog-header"><h2 class="title">Export citation</h2><form method="dialog"><button aria-label="close" class="close-button close-modal"><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Close icon</title><path d="M2 2L14 14M2 14L14 2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></form></div><div class="flex flex-col w-full gap-2 tablet:flex-row tablet:gap-8 tablet:items-center"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h1 class="t-lg-regular">Export citation</h1><p>Choose format for download:</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 tablet:flex-row tablet:gap-4"><fieldset class="flex flex-col" name="export_format"><label class="t-base-regular"><input checked="" data-action="change-&gt;export-citation#load" data-export-citation-target="format" data-format="bibtex" name="export_format" type="radio" value="bibtex" /><span class="pl-2">BibTeX</span></label><label class="t-base-regular"><input data-action="change-&gt;export-citation#load" data-export-citation-target="format" data-format="ris" name="export_format" type="radio" value="ris" /><span class="pl-2">EndNote (RIS)</span></label></fieldset><a class="sm-primary-button self-center" data-component-type="citation_download" data-export-citation-target="download" download=